Third-party components

The built website includes the following third-party components. Each remains under
its own licence, and those licences apply to those components only.

- React and React DOM (MIT License), https://github.com/facebook/react
- lucide-react icons (ISC License), https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide
- clsx (MIT License), https://github.com/lukeed/clsx
- tailwind-merge (MIT License), https://github.com/dcastil/tailwind-merge
- Tailwind CSS (MIT License), https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss
- Zen Old Mincho font (SIL Open Font License 1.1), via Fontsource
- Zen Maru Gothic font (SIL Open Font License 1.1), via Fontsource
- DotGothic16 font (SIL Open Font License 1.1), via Fontsource

The full licence texts are included with each package in node_modules after
running npm install.
